    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking lisinopril for my blood pressure a week ago and im feeling kinda lightheaded/dizzy everytime i stand up from the couch. should i maybe take two of them tomorrow just to get it over with and help my body adjust or like take them at night instead? im worried the dose isnt working right if i feel like this",
