      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it could be bad but my doctor is super busy and i cant really get an appointment until next week. it's just a little dizziness and it goes away after a sec. if i just take it at night instead of the morning like i usually do, would that help me sleep through the dizzy feeling? i really dont want to wait a whole week if i can just fix it myself.",
